PROVENANCE MODEL FOR THE VENDORED LIBRARIES (1-5)
  Their source is NOT committed to this repository. Cathode/install.sh clones each at a pinned
  commit into the repository-root vendor/lib/cathode/<lib>/ (gitignored) and verifies
  `git rev-parse HEAD == pin` on every run. The pinned commit IS the provenance: it identifies
  exactly which upstream tree a given notice covers. Each pin below was read from Cathode/install.sh
  and confirmed against the live clone's HEAD on 2026-07-23.


